    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash '/home/jehad/.claude/hooks/ask-git-commit-push.sh'",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "^(startup|resume|clear|compact|fork)$",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash '/home/jehad/.claude/hooks/herdr-agent-state.sh' session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "bash ~/.claude/statusline-command.sh"
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "gopls-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "frontend-design@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "mattpocock-skills@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "coderabbit@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "drafts@dotfiles-mods": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "dotfiles-mods": {
      "source": {
        "source": "directory",
        "path": "/home/jehad/dotfiles/claude/.claude/mods"
      }
    }
  },
  "sandbox": {
    "enabled": false,
    "autoAllowBashIfSandboxed": true,
    "allowUnsandboxedCommands": true
  },
  "effortLevel": "medium",
  "modelSettings": {
    "claude-opus-5": {
      "effortLevel": "high"
    },
    "claude-sonnet-5": {
      "effortLevel": "high"
    },
    "claude-opus-5-5": {
      "effortLevel": "medium"
    }
  },
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "voice": {
    "enabled": false,
    "mode": "tap"
  },
  "autoMemoryEnabled": false,
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "inputNeededNotifEnabled": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: assume private unless the remote host and repo name indicate otherwise, or a visibility check in the transcript shows public (repo visibility not queryable here; remote is a private Tailscale-hosted git server ssh://git.tail7d3230.ts.net/mamacrm/backend.git — treat as private)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: development (default branch; protection status not queryable here)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (ssh://git.tail7d3230.ts.net/mamacrm/backend.git) and its remote(s) only (no additional orgs configured)",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: git.tail7d3230.ts.net",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar; note .env is gitignored in this repo, indicating local secrets should stay untracked",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment (hyphen/underscore/dot-delimited)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (Go backend, mamacrm project — postgres/redis runtime dependencies, templ/just/golangci-lint toolchain)",
      "**Trusted repo**: /home/jehad/dev/work/mamacrm/backend and its remote ssh://git.tail7d3230.ts.net/mamacrm/backend.git",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "routine under /home/jehad/dev/work/mamacrm/backend/ prefix: build, lint, test, and run tasks via just/go/templ/tparse/golangci-lint, and psql access to the project's local postgres per README runtime dependencies",
      "**Trusted repo**: /home/jehad/dev/work/mamacrm/frontend, its worktrees (/home/jehad/dev/work/mamacrm/frontend.* and backend.*), and its remote on the same git server as the backend",
      "**Local dev services**: the Docker containers named mamacrm-common-services-* (Postgres, Redis) and the backend on localhost:6175 hold disposable dev data; psql and redis-cli queries against them, including creating and dropping qa_ or HUNT-QA tables and rows, are routine",
      "**Test account**: the throwaway login under 'Testing credentials' in the frontend AGENTS.md exists for automated tests; logging in with it through curl or playwright-cli against localhost or the dev servers is routine and expected",
      "**Dev hosts**: hosts under the git server's tailnet domain (*.ts.net) on ports 5170-5179 serve this user's own vite dev servers; browsing and testing them with playwright-cli is routine",
      "**Still sensitive**: decrypting stored OAuth tokens (for example with token_encryption_key from the backend config.yaml) touches real third-party credentials; keep treating that as credential access"
    ]
